      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The purpose of the research was definition of clinical current and diagnostic criteria of varicose veins of pelvis minor at woman of pre-menopause and post-menopause. The varicose veins of pelvis minor at woman of pre-menopause and post-menopause is characterized by decrease in a painful syndrome with heavy organic and functional defeat of veins system of a pelvis minor. The diagnostic criteria offered by the author will allow improving diagnostics of disease at women."},
